# =============================================================================
# 00_table_text.R — captions and notes of the Supplementary Appendix tables.
#
# Sourced by 00_utils.R. standardize_notes() (called by postprocess_tex() and
# write_table_tex()) ends with apply_table_text(file): when the file's basename
# has an entry below, its caption text and its note are replaced by the entry,
# so a re-run of any script reproduces the edited text instead of reverting it.
# The significance line is appended to a note whenever the table prints stars.
# Edit a supplement caption or note HERE, not in the script that builds the
# table.
# =============================================================================

